Black Shard stub package (AGPL-3.0-only, same licence as the fork).

The upstream @documenso/ee package is licensed under the Documenso
Commercial License and is not distributed in this fork. This package is a
Black Shard reimplementation of the module surface community code imports:
self-hosted limits are unlimited, billing operations are no-ops, and
enterprise-only features are unavailable at runtime.
